            "custom_collection_image": "shopify://shop_images/6_WINDSWEPT2.jpg",
            "heading": "Movement, rhythm, effortless grace — the WINDSWEPT PALMS Collection explores the beauty of palms transformed by wind and motion. Through flowing forms, shifting silhouettes, and moments of natural movement, these photographs celebrate the freedom, romance, and quiet poetry found within the natural world.",
