            "heading": "Night skies, luminous forms, unexpected magic — the MOONLIT PALMS Collection explores the transformation of the Palm, beneath the glow of moonlight. Through contrast, illumination, and silhouette, these photographs celebrate the quiet wonder and enchantment revealed when when nature is seen in a new light.",
